<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-029-code-traceability-builder-assessor-claude-fable-5-1> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) T1917-029: logarithmic-spiral chamber succession with constant ratio vs Shi (2021) fusulinid half-whorl series (Pass 2) — Code-to-model traceability: 78/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Every model function cites its page/equation; the verdict thresholds are named module constants with the pre-registration source in a comment; the KG YAML code loci were updated to the v2 line ranges; the CV thresholds are stated in the docstrings. Docked because the analysis-side conventions (PCA frame, 0.85 break threshold, 5-95 % trimming, 10 % drift) are documented but not sourced to any publication." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
